@details
1 | description |
  Implement the LoopSpecConfig struct with fields for include_task, include_plan_section, additional_specs, max_spec_tokens, and spec_template. Include Default implementation. This sets up the configuration for spec loading.
2 | description |
  Add a spec field of type LoopSpecConfig to ScudLoopConfig with default serde. This allows configuration of spec behavior in the main loop config.
3 | description |
  Create the build_task_spec method in ScudIterativeLoop that combines task details, plan sections, and additional specs. Include helpers for format_task_spec and extract_plan_section, with token warning logic.
3.1 | description |
  Create the helper methods format_task_spec and extract_plan_section, and implement the token warning logic in the ScudIterativeLoop class. Ensure these are independently testable and handle combining task details, plan sections, and additional specs as needed.
3.2 | description |
  Implement the build_task_spec method in ScudIterativeLoop that combines task details, plan sections, and additional specs using the helper methods and incorporating token warning logic.
4 | description |
  Add build_task_prompt, spawn_claude_agent, and parse_task_result methods to ScudIterativeLoop. Define TaskExecutionResult enum. This enables spawning Claude agents for task execution with fresh context.
4.1 | description |
  Define the TaskExecutionResult enum to represent possible outcomes of task execution by Claude agents.
4.2 | description |
  Implement build_task_prompt, spawn_claude_agent, and parse_task_result methods in ScudIterativeLoop to enable spawning Claude agents with fresh context for task execution.
5 | description |
  Refactor execute_task to use the new sub-agent spawning. Update the main execute loop to handle TaskExecutionResult variants, including verification and handling blocked tasks.
6 | description |
  Extend LoopStartArgs in loop_cmd.rs with --scud-tag, --plan, --spec-file, --max-spec-tokens, and --verify options. This allows CLI invocation with SCUD integration.
7 | description |
  Modify execute_start in loop_cmd.rs to detect --scud-tag and instantiate ScudIterativeLoop with appropriate config. Ensure it falls back to generic loop otherwise.
8 | description |
  Create .claude/commands/ralph-wiggum/ralph-loop.md with description, arguments parsing, and execution logic to start the loop via Descartes CLI. Include output format for status reporting.
9 | description |
  Implement .claude/commands/ralph-wiggum/cancel-ralph.md and help.md with descriptions, execution steps, and output formats. These provide commands to cancel loops and show help.
10 | description |
  Write unit tests for spec building and task execution parsing in scud_loop.rs. Create integration test with mock SCUD tasks. Update relevant documentation files like blog posts and README.
10.1 | description |
  Write unit tests for spec building and task execution parsing in scud_loop.rs. Create an integration test using mock SCUD tasks to verify end-to-end functionality.
10.2 | description |
  Update relevant documentation files, including blog posts and README, to reflect the new tests and any changes in functionality.
